This is the source commit declared by the Lyricify.Lyrics.Helper 0.2.0 NuGet
package. The source project's own version properties at this commit say 0.1.4;
they are preserved rather than representing this source fork as an unmodified
NuGet binary. Only the library directory is included, with the original LICENSE
and README.upstream.md. No demo application or song-lyric demo data is included.

TaskBarWidgets modifications, 2026-10-16:
- Target net8.0, matching the product and its existing OpenCC dependency.
- Replace CHTCHSConv 1.0.0 with OpenCC 0.1.0. In ChineseHelper.cs only S2T/T2S
  conversion calls use lazy generic-script OpenCC converters (cn/t); public
  methods, null/ref handling, default dictionary conversion and forced cleanup
  remain available. Regional vocabulary localization is not requested.
- Build from a project reference instead of shipping the NuGet helper binary
  and its unsigned ChineseConverter.dll dependency of unestablished provenance.

All other library source files are unchanged from the pinned commit. Parser,
decrypter, provider and search APIs are retained. Conversion dictionaries differ
from the old backend, so ambiguous phrases can resolve differently.

